# Enforce LF line endings in the repository for all text files.
# This locks in the policy set by .prettierrc ("endOfLine": "lf") and
# .editorconfig (end_of_line = lf) at the git layer so the normalisation
# happens regardless of each contributor's local core.autocrlf setting.
#
# text=auto lets Git auto-detect binary files (no normalisation applied to
# them). eol=lf writes LF into the working tree on every platform.
#
# One-time setup (run once after this file is committed and checked out):
#   git add --renormalize .
# This re-stages every tracked file with the new attributes so any CRLF
# currently in the index is normalised before the next push.

* text=auto eol=lf
